The Python optimizer and interval counting implementation are newly authored;
the algorithms and attribution are retained. This is not described as clean-room
work. No upstream C/C++ code, BAM files, or biological datasets are redistributed.
Synthetic reference data were generated by reference/generate.R.

Please cite the original methods as well as this implementation. References are
listed in docs/provenance.md.
